==Miscellaneous==
*Added 4 new [[User Rank]] rewards:
**13,001 raises [[Superfeline (Normal Cat)|Superfeline]]'s level cap from 20+50 to 20+60
**18,500 grants +5 Legend [[Catseye]]s
**18,600 grants +5 Special Catseyes
**18,700 grants +5 Rare Catseyes
*Added clear formation option.
*Added 1 new item used in the 10th Anniversary Event gacha: Legendary Freebie.
*[[Catburger (Special Cat)|Catburger]], [[Maneki Cat (Special Cat)|Maneki Cat]] and [[Coin Cat (Special Cat)|Coin Cat]]'s + level cap increased to 30.
*[[Million-Dollar Cat (Special Cat)|Million-Dollar Cat]]'s + level cap increased to 10.
*Increased HP, speed, cost and cooldown of [[:Category:Ancient Eggs|Ancient Eggs]].
*Numbers of crowns obtained now show on [[Legend Stages]] menu.
*Added an option to not show last used formation from a previous victory when replaying an already beaten stage.

